{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 2, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 13115792722802933495, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "parse_date accepts Z as UTC; naive inputs still parse\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1792277400.0630064, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1792277400.0630064, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1792277400.0630064, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 115, "mtime": 1792277400.0630064, "sha256": "0c028942684af7b8390dd98146e21d481c544a6c63ffe5db76c1057dd6763df1"}, "conftest.py": {"bytes": 170, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "06b695b20fd58f648912e2ff9e51ad183c9f2203f2786182ac0916ea4102d983"}, "dates/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "dates/parse.py": {"bytes": 212, "mtime": 1792277390.4710064, "sha256": "b1d2a10cb5bffe799fa52776a3e04d1cf7f99917f62f5839ad48f903af8ee2ce"}, "tests/test_parse.py": {"bytes": 371, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "491695a5fb3286eaa6bd1eb3ba834d44a5b64980e878703f60e07aa02d7fa041"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_parse.py::test_dates` fails with `ValueError: unconverted data remains: Z`. Please fix `parse_date`.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/transcripts/aa-2/trig-omp-reported/21/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/cells/aa-2/trig-omp-reported/21/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "aa-2", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/17.3.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "`datetime.fromisoformat` accepts `Z` and `\u00b1HH:MM` offsets on Python \u22653.11 (env is 3.13), and still parses naive strings.\nI fixed `parse_date` in `dates/parse.py`, and all three tests in `tests/test_parse.py` now pass, including `test_dates`.\n\n**Cause:** `strptime(s, \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\")` has no slot for a time zone, so the trailing `Z` in `\"2026-10-12T08:30:00Z\"` was left over and raised the error.\n\n**Fix:** it now uses `datetime.fromisoformat(s)`. On Python 3.11 and later (this environment is 3.13.5), that accepts `Z`, offsets like `+02:00`, and timestamps with no zone.\n\n**Behaviour change:** strings ending in `Z` or an offset now come back as zone-aware datetimes; strings with no zone still come back without one, as before. If code compares or subtracts the two kinds against each other, Python raises a `TypeError`.\n\n**Version note:** the repo doesn't pin a Python version (there's no `pyproject.toml`, `setup.cfg` or `setup.py`). On Python 3.10 or earlier, `fromisoformat` rejects `Z`, so this fix needs 3.11+.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests":